                <mxCell id="999" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Business rules / constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;PURCHASE_REQUEST targets one specific secondhand item.&lt;br&gt;• Buyer and seller are relationship roles played by USER. They are not subtypes.&lt;br&gt;• Every transaction has exactly one buyer and one seller.&lt;br&gt;• Pickup point is for every transaction.&lt;br&gt;• A transaction may have at most two reviews: buyer to seller and seller to buyer.&lt;br&gt;• REPORT targets either one item or one transaction, but not both (XOR).&lt;br&gt;• Transaction reports may only be submitted by buyer or seller.&lt;br&gt;• SAVES is M:N with relationship attribute date_saved." vertex="1">
